(b) Vieta: (-1)^3 * (-t r0)/(-t r_3) = (+-) r0/r_3, t-free
  t = 0.01: total fiber product = 2.000000-0.000000i (expect r0/r4 = 2 up to sign)
  t = (0.03+0.02j): total fiber product = 2.000000+0.000000i (expect r0/r4 = 2 up to sign)
  t = 0.05j: total fiber product = 2.000000-0.000000i (expect r0/r4 = 2 up to sign)
